WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.050
[Low ringing tone and dry paper scrapes]

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.950
[Four hollow thumps travel from left to right]

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.480
[A brushing sound gives way to four rising tones]

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.650
[A low swell, then a thud and three dry ticks]

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.600
[A low ring gives way to a brighter glassy chime]

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:16.550
[Four taps fall in pitch]

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.300
[A ball bounces. A low tone follows.]

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.980
[The last note rings out and fades]
